# MultiHop-RAG: every RAG solution on one public dataset

This is RAGBench's published benchmark. **Every RAG solution RAGBench can run** (its built-in pipelines and agents, three frameworks' tutorial pipelines and three agent harnesses) answers the same {{ n }} questions over the same corpus of news articles, with one generator and a judge from another model family. A second run swaps the generator for six open-weight models. Every number on this page is generated from the result files in [`multihop-rag-run/`](multihop-rag-run/), [`multihop-rag-harnesses-run/`](multihop-rag-harnesses-run/) and [`multihop-rag-models-run/`](multihop-rag-models-run/) by `scripts/check_results.py`, and CI fails if the page and the files disagree. What the metrics mean is in the [methodology](../methodology.md).

